### Register Customer 1
POST http://localhost:5290/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Customer One",
  "userName": "customer1",
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+8801712345678",
  "password": "Customer@12345"
}

### Register Customer 2
POST http://localhost:5290/api/auth/register
