### Get Customer 1 confirmed bookings
GET http://localhost:5290/api/booking/confirmed
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ZHUUT0ymbiCk5ue5LqsDzMwalb-k4NLEYUyP_waX3bg
